WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.710
I'm No. V, Nizer Bruckheimer!

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:08.720
I'm No. VII, Jenos Hazard!

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:12.720
I'm No. XI, Beluga J Heard!

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:17.720
We're Chrono Numbers'
surprise attack assassination force,

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.730
--Cerberus!
--Cerberus!
--Cerberus!

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.060
Let's confirm the operation's objective!

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.730
Our target is the head of the
Apostles of the Stars' leader, Creed!

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.740
We'll take him down
no matter what the price!

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.860
All right, then! Let's go, you two!

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:41.410
Well well, Chronos is coming, Creed.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.080
What!? Kuro-<i>sama's</i> coming?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.420
It's Chronos!

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.750
Boo...

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:50.760
To think that they're coming to us...

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:53.760
It's a chance for us to
let the Numbers have it.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.250
I can hardly wait!

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:00.060
It's not them...

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:07.060
The one I'm waiting for
isn't scum like them...

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:15.720
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:22.880
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:42.010
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:48.350
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:54.690
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:54.690 --> 00:02:01.030
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:07.530
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:14.040
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:17.040
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:27.040
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:43.970
"Fighting Cat"

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:49.170
It's a nice moonlit night.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.210
The milk's good, too.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:02.690
Saya!

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.360
Hey, you want some, too?

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.690
No, thanks.

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:11.360
All I wanted tonight was
to tell you something, so...

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:14.030
Hmm? What is it?

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:16.370
About me...

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:18.700
It's okay to forget about me now.

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:24.570
S-... Saya!!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.880
Saya...

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.710
What's the matter, Eve?

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:32.040
Train's gone.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.050
What!?

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.920
I think he got that man to tell him where
the Apostles of the Stars' hideout is

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.610
and took Mister's motorcycle to get there.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:53.730
Hey! Where the hell did Train go!?

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.740
Where the hell is the
Apostles of the Stars' hideout!?

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:59.400
H- hey! Calm down!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.310
How could I calm down!?

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.220
Oh?

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.700
Train...

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:34.140
Even after all I said,
you still don't get it!?

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.380
Listen up, Train!

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:42.380
If you die or something,

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.010
I'll punch you again!!

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:16.350
How dare you run amok in Sangeles City,

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.940
Apostles of the Stars!

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:22.690
So you aren't willing to
make way for us without a fight?

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.360
Our target is Creed only.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:31.030
We prefer to avoid
unnecessary fights, you know.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:35.370
Don't say things that
don't match your face, No. V.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:40.710
It's written on your face
that you're itching to fight!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:47.380
Man... I did want to play the pacifist
once in a while, though.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:51.720
If you want to go through here,
do it by force!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.050
Man, are we being mocked or what?

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:57.720
The first welcoming party consists of

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:58.720
a sumo wrestler,

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.720
a little kid,

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.850
and a girl, huh?

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.670
I'll put an end to that mouth of yours,

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.000
foolish old timer!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.670
What!? Hold it, you brat!

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:15.900
I can't let it pass that
you called me old timer!

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.980
Whew!

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.350
I get pissed...

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.380
by people who treat me like a child.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.950
Is this kid a typhoon?

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.920
What!?

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:51.040
Listen up, I'll tell you something...

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:54.380
I'm not a sumo wrestler.

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:57.720
This is an ethnic costume from Itairiku!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:01.320
Remember it well!

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:04.660
I'll tell you something, too.
Your enemy is...

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.120
right here!

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:15.330
Wow, cool!!

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.770
But, I'll keep up with others, too!

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:24.830
Boo...

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:28.680
This is becoming interesting!

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:33.690
I have to give educational guidance
to a cocky child as well!

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.380
You really piss me off!

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.960
You're too young!

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:47.190
What!?

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:49.700
All right.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.700
Beluga! Nizer!

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.190
Here we go!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.380
Crap!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:58.930
One more time!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.980
Sorry kids!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:08.250
This is another one of
those grown-up things!

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:14.490
I guess this is to be expected
from the Numbers...

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.390
Let's go...

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:23.330
Oh, hurry to me...

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.330
Train!

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.950
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!?

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:41.320
Wh- what the hell...

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:47.690
Ah... That's Mister's motorcycle...

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.360
Could this be Train's work?

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.360
No, it's not.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:56.030
It's too flamboyant to be
Train's way of doing things.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:58.040
Looks like they've already
had visitors before us...

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.040
Visitors before us...

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.710
Hey!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.040
Why is it Jenos!?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.050
Oh?

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.570
Hey! Wait for me!!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.730
Oh? What happened to Eve?

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:25.400
Now that you mention it...

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.200
I wonder if she got lost somewhere...

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.100
Nizer!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:37.410
Not bad,

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:41.110
sensing it and keeping it
from hitting your heart...

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.210
Y- you're!

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:52.060
I'm surprised...

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.760
to see that the great
international actress, Echidna Parass,

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:59.130
is a member of the Apostles of the Stars!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.700
The die is already cast!

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.100
Whoa!

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:11.380
The time has finally come
to crush Chronos.

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:13.710
Bloody Rain!

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.380
I won't let you get away!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.940
Take this! Dragonfly Curse!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:22.280
What's wrong?
You're missing the target, Numbers!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.540
Umph!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.070
Welcome, Train!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:47.070
I knew you'd come.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:52.840
So, you finally decided
to become one of my allies!

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.110
Don't mock me!!

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:44.220
Why're you obsessed with me?

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:49.730
Go right ahead and shoot, Train.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:51.400
What!?

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:56.070
The old you would shoot
without hesitation.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:14:01.350
You were the only one not
like those others in Chronos.

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:05.020
You detested the world
and trusted no one but yourself.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:08.350
You just sought to become stronger.

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:12.690
That's your true self, Train Heartnet!

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:17.560
You truly are the same
kind of human as I am!

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:22.370
Now, Train,

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:25.370
shoot through my head!

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:30.830
Pull that trigger and
go back to the old Train!

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:07.350
Train!

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:09.310
You!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:17.360
Train, this is my resolution.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.520
If it's for you, time is no obstacle.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:26.030
I'll show you I can eliminate
everything that tries to change you.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:29.230
Now, shoot me!

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.060
Charden!!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:02.670
Echidna!!

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:06.000
Don't come between Train and I!!

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.010
But, Creed,

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:10.010
Black Cat doesn't have
any intention of joinin...

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:12.340
Shut up!!

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:14.110
I'll kill you...

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:18.680
Rins-<i>chan</i>!

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.350
Jenos!!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:23.320
Are you trying to get in my way, too!?

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.660
Jenos!!

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.170
Creed!

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:50.380
Jenos!!

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:54.980
I love you!! Rins-<i>chan</i>!!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:09.330
Train and I are about to
be bound together right now.

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:12.200
I won't let anyone come close to us!

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:20.010
Now, there's no one to
get in our way any more.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.010
Let's take time and fight, Train.

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:24.680
Don't, Train!

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:30.020
That's right! Instead of fighting
a jerk like him, come and rescue me!!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:33.020
I don't know what happened in the past,

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:36.690
but even if you kill a jerk like him,
it wouldn't make Saya happy!!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.770
I'll really kill you!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:56.050
Now, Train,

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:59.380
aim at my head and shoot.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:04.150
I'll accept it no matter
what kind of bullet it is.

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:10.290
And, when I accept it,
you and I will be bound!

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:20.670
Right! That look in your eyes!

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:24.510
That's your true self, Train!

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:29.540
Now, keep going and pull the trigger!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:37.750
What was that!?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:47.030
You pretended to aim at me, but you
were actually aiming at the castle!

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:51.370
Let's go, Creed!
The castle's coming down!

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:53.560
Train! Get out of here!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:19.000
Hey!! Do something!!

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.690
Exactly what do you suggest
I do in this situation!?

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:25.830
Eve-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.340
Eve! Don't overdo it!!

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:32.640
Give it your best! Eve-<i>chan</i>!!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.450
Oh?

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.390
No way...

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:06.270
To think that... Train just disappeared...
from my sight...

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:10.710
Creed!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.780
C- crap!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:52.120
Oh well... I couldn't get any clues
about Shinkitou after all...

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:56.490
Jenos...

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:03.030
Well, I guess there's no way the
Chrono Numbers would die so easily...

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:10.040
So, why'd you drop the showdown
with Creed and come to rescue us?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:14.040
Like I said, I don't know.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.710
I know why.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:21.020
That means that you're not
a Chronos' eraser any more, Train.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.730
I don't know...

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.060
By the way...

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.070
Hmm?

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:40.230
Was that Saya girl your girlfriend?

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.440
It wasn't like that.

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:54.880
My best friend... I suppose...

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:06.060
Hmm... In other words,
you were rejected, Train...

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:15.540
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:19.540
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:25.310
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:40.230
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:43.170
<i>Around the time</i>
<i>the first evening star appears,</i>

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:46.000
<i>I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:51.910
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:54.910
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:54.910 --> 00:22:58.150
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:58.150 --> 00:23:01.520
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:07.190
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:13.200
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:16.200
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:19.540
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:22.370
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:25.880
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:32.210
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:41.060
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:42.590
<i>Ahh! Kuro-sama is the best!</i>
"Next Episode"

00:23:42.590 --> 00:23:44.060
<i>Ahh! Kuro-sama is the best!</i>

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:46.400
<i>Kind Kuro-sama's handsome too,</i>

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:50.730
<i>but that grim face he shows</i>
<i>when he's fighting is too cool!</i>

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:55.070
<i>Oh, just remembering it</i>
<i>makes my heart pound.</i>

00:23:55.070 --> 00:23:56.740
<i>I decided...</i>

00:23:56.740 --> 00:24:00.340
<i>that I'll try my luck on the day</i>
<i>that girls push chocolates on boys...</i>

00:24:00.340 --> 00:24:01.610
<i>I'll show everyone that I can</i>
<i>definitely win Kuro-sama's heart!</i>

00:24:01.610 --> 00:24:03.580
"Love Cat"
<i>I'll show everyone that I can</i>
<i>definitely win Kuro-sama's heart!</i>

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:04.570
"Love Cat"
